# .dockerignore — repo root
# Build context = repository root (`docker build -f src/docker/Dockerfile .`).
# Restrict the context to source code only: factory metadata, wiki, design,
# raw inputs, and editor caches must NOT enter the image layers.
# [^src: management/kanban/.../TSK-032.md §`.dockerignore`]

# VCS
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Factory / docs / planning (out of code_path)
.claude/
wiki/
memory/
management/
design_&_architecture/
# Eccezione: l'OpenAPI canonico serve allo stage fe-build del Dockerfile per il
# codegen del client TS (lib/api/generated/schema.ts è gitignored → rigenerato
# nell'immagine). Docker re-include un file anche sotto una dir esclusa via `!`.
!design_&_architecture/api/openapi.yaml
raw/
PATTERN.md
CLAUDE.md
*.md
!src/**/*.md

# IDE / editor
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Node / Next
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/.turbo/
**/.cache/
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Java / Gradle
**/.gradle/
**/build/
**/out/
**/*.class
**/.kotlin/

# Test artefacts
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/htmlcov/

# Docker leftovers
**/Dockerfile.dev
**/docker-compose.override.yml

# CI workflows are not needed inside the image
.github/
